# 10-Guardrails-Middleware
# Empty placeholders only. Never commit .env or real credentials.
# Configure only what you use; remove unused assignments before loading .env.
# Empty is not always equivalent to unset and can override working defaults/keys.
# src/guardrails/{pii,rules,providers,api}.py read these settings.
# Set process environment variables; .env is not automatically loaded.
# Config variables select YAML files. Finding logs are opt-in and may contain user text.

GUARDRAILS_PII_CONFIG=
